## Scope of this license

This license covers the original source code in this repository: the OREBOT
Network contracts in `contracts/` and the application and package code in
`apps/` and `packages/`, to the extent each was authored for this project.

It does **not** cover third-party components. Those retain their own licenses
and are enumerated in `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`. Files that carry a different
`SPDX-License-Identifier` header are governed by the header they declare.

